\[ 1988 + k + 8891 = 0 \]
\[ k = -10879 \]

2. For \( x_0 = -1 \):
\[ 1988(-1)^2 + k(-1) + 8891 = 0 \]
\[ 1988 - k + 8891 = 0 \]
\[ 1988 + 8891 - k = 0 \]
\[ k = 10879 \]

