Next, we need to determine the total thickness of the stack. The thickness of the washers forms an arithmetic sequence where the first term \(a_1\) is 1 cm and the common difference \(d\) is -0.1 cm. The thickness of the \(n\)-th washer is given by:
\[a_n = 1 + (n-1)(-0.1) = 1 - 0.1(n-1)\]
