\[x = \frac{-4a_1 + 4a_2}{a_1 - a_2} = 4\]

Then we substitute \(x = 4\) back into one of the new equations to find \(y\):
\[a_1 \cdot 4 + 2y = -4a_1 - 10 \Rightarrow 4a_1 + 2y = -4a_1 - 10 \Rightarrow 2y = -8a_1 - 10 \Rightarrow y = -4a_1 - 5\]

