To be specific, we need at least one 2, one 0, one 1, and one 8 in the seven-digit number, and we need to arrange these digits and other digits (which we can choose from 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 9) in such a way that the first digit is not 2 and we can remove some digits to get 2018.

