\[ 2^{325} + 1 = (2^{25})^{13} + 1 = (2^{25} + 1)(2^{300} - 2^{275} + 2^{250} - 2^{225} + 2^{200} - 2^{175} + 2^{150} - 2^{125} + 2^{100} - 2^{75} + 2^{50} - 2^{25} + 1). \]

Thus, we can simplify:
\[ N = 2^{300} - 2^{275} + 2^{250} - 2^{225} + 2^{200} - 2^{175} + 2^{150} - 2^{125} + 2^{100} - 2^{75} + 2^{50} - 2^{25} + 1. \]

This expression can thus be written as a sum of distinct powers of 2:
\[ N = 2^{300} + 2^{250} + 2^{200} + 2^{150} + 2^{100} + 2^{50} + 1 - (2^{275} + 2^{225} + 2^{175} + 2^{125} + 2^{75} + 2^{25}). \]

