\[ S_{17} = \frac{17}{2} (2 + 16(-0.1)) \]
\[ S_{17} = \frac{17}{2} (2 - 1.6) \]
\[ S_{17} = \frac{17}{2} \times 0.4 \]
\[ S_{17} = 17 \times 0.2 \]
\[ S_{17} = 3.4 \]

So, the total height of the stack is 3.4 cm. Since the top of the top washer is 0.5 cm from the top surface (we assume the top washer is only 0.5 cm thick), the total height from the bottom of the bottom washer to the top of the top washer is:
