Next, we express \(a_6\) in terms of \(a_4\) and \(a_5\):
\[a_4 + a_5 + a_6 = 2 \cdot 4\]
\[1012 + 1013 + a_6 = 8\]
\[a_6 = 8 - 2025 = -2017.\]

Next, we express \(a_7\) in terms of \(a_5\) and \(a_6\):
\[a_5 + a_6 + a_7 = 2 \cdot 5\]
\[1013 - 2017 + a_7 = 10\]
