\[a_{10} = 20 + 996 = 1016.\]
This confirms the pattern \(a_{4k+4} = 1012 + 4k\).

Given the pattern, we can now find \(a_{1000}\). Since 1000 is of the form \(4k\) (specifically, \(1000 = 4 \cdot 250\)), we use the pattern \(a_{4k+4} = 1012 + 4k\):
