- **1 streak**: This means all 10 rounds are won by one person. There are 2 outcomes (either all Richard wins or all Shreyas wins). So there are 2 outcomes with 1 streak.
- **2 streaks**: This means there are two consecutive wins by Richard followed by two consecutive wins by Shreyas, and so on. The sequence must alternate between RRRR... and SSSS... after the first segment. The only way to have exactly 2 streaks is if the sequence is either RRRRRRRRRR, SSSSSSSSSS, RRRRRRRRSS, RRSSSSSSSS, SSRRRRRRRR, or SSSSSSSSRR. This gives us 6 outcomes with 2 streaks.

