We simplify each term:
\[
\frac{x_1^2}{-\frac{25 + 5x_1^2}{x_1} + 1} = \frac{x_1^3}{-25 - 5x_1^2 + x_1} = \frac{x_1^3}{x_1 - 25 - 5x_1^2}.
