\[ a_{33} = 33^2 + 32^2 = 1089 + 1024 = 2113 \]
Since \( a_{33} = 2113 > 2014 \) and \( a_{32} = 1985 < 2014 \), the last stage for which the figure uses less than 2014 squares is 32.

