\[ f(x) = 10^{2x} - 7^{-x} \]
\[ f'(x) = \frac{d}{dx}(10^{2x}) - \frac{d}{dx}(7^{-x}) \]
\[ f'(x) = 2 \cdot 10^{2x} \ln 10 - (-7^{-x} \ln 7) = 2 \cdot 10^{2x} \ln 10 + 7^{-x} \ln 7 \]

2. Calculate \(g'(x)\):
