- Ed drank \(\frac{3}{4} \times 32 + \frac{1}{8} \times 32 + 2 = 24 + 4 + 2 = 30\) ounces.
- Ann drank \(\frac{9}{8} \times 32 - (\frac{1}{8} \times 32 + 2) = 36 - 6 = 30\) ounces.

Therefore, together they drank \(30 + 30 = 60\) ounces.

