\[a_1 + a_2 + a_3 = 2 \cdot 1 = 2\]
So,
\[1010 + 1011 + a_3 = 2\]
\[a_3 = 2 - (1010 + 1011) = 2 - 2021 = -2019\]

For \(n = 2\):
\[a_2 + a_3 + a_4 = 2 \cdot 2 = 4\]
So,
\[1011 - 2019 + a_4 = 4\]
\[a_4 = 4 - (1011 - 2019) = 4 + 1008 = 1012\]

For \(n = 3\):
\[a_3 + a_4 + a_5 = 2 \cdot 3 = 6\]
