- For Group A, the number of ways to select 1 female out of 3 females is C(3,1), and to select 1 male out of 5 males is C(5,1). For Group B, the number of ways to select 1 male out of 6 males is C(6,1) and 1 male out of the remaining 5 males is C(5,1).
