4a^4b^4 = 16a^2b^2c^2 \implies (a^2b^2)^2 = 4a^2b^2 (a^2 + b^2)
\]
Simplify:
\[
a^2b^2 (a^2b^2 - 4a^2 - 4b^2) = 0
