First, we compute $\mathbf{B}^2$:

\[
\mathbf{B}^2 = \mathbf{B} \cdot \mathbf{B} = \begin{pmatrix} 3 & 8 \\ -2 & -5 \end{pmatrix} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 3 & 8 \\ -2 & -5 \end{pmatrix}
\]

Let's calculate this using Python.
