For each pair, we have the equation \( pq \mid 15(p-1)(q-1) \). This implies that \( pq \) must be a factor of \( 15(p-1)(q-1) \). We can check this by verifying if \( \frac{15(p-1)(q-1)}{pq} \) is an integer.

Let's start with the smallest primes and check each pair.
