\]
We can represent this transformation using a matrix:
\[
\begin{pmatrix}
a_{n+1} \\
b_{n+1}
\end{pmatrix}
=
\begin{pmatrix}
\sqrt{3} & -1 \\
1 & \sqrt{3}
\end{pmatrix}
\begin{pmatrix}
a_n \\
b_n
\end{pmatrix}
\]

Let's denote the matrix as \( A \):
\[
