\]
The eigenvalues are \( \sqrt{3} + i \) and \( \sqrt{3} - i \). These eigenvalues can be written as \( 2 \left( \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} + \frac{i}{2} \right) = 2e^{i\pi/6} \) and \( 2 \left( \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} - \frac{i}{2} \right) = 2e^{-i\pi/6} \), respectively.

