Rechecking the consistency, we see that if \( A = 30 \), then the total number of children is \( T + L + 30 = 31 \), so \( T + L = 1 \). Given \( T = 7 \) and \( L = 1 \), it is consistent. So, the number of truth-tellers is \( T = 7 \).

