The area can be calculated as:

\[ \text{Area} = \int_{0}^{2} \left(\sqrt{x^3 + 1} - (-\sqrt[3]{x^2 + 2x}) \right) dx = \int_{0}^{2} \left(\sqrt{x^3 + 1} + \sqrt[3]{x^2 + 2x} \right) dx \]

