2. Rewrite the division as multiplication by the reciprocal: $\frac{a^{4} - a^{2} b^{2}}{(a - b)^{2}} \div \frac{a(a + b)}{b^{2}} \cdot \frac{b^{2}}{a} = \frac{a^2(a - b)(a + b)}{(a - b)^2} \cdot \frac{b^2}{a(a + b)} \cdot \frac{b^2}{a}$.
3. Simplify the expression by canceling out common factors: $\frac{a^2(a - b)(a + b)}{(a - b)^2} \cdot \frac{b^2}{a(a + b)} \cdot \frac{b^2}{a} = \frac{a \cdot (a - b) \cdot (a + b)}{(a - b) \cdot (a - b)} \cdot \frac{b^2}{a \cdot (a + b)} \cdot \frac{b^2}{a} = \frac{a \cdot b^2}{a - b} \cdot \frac{b^2}{a} = \frac{b^4}{a - b}$.

