\]
Simplifying inside the absolute value:
\[
= \frac{1}{2} \left| \frac{s}{2} \left( \frac{\sqrt{3}}{4}s - s \right) + s \left( s - \frac{\sqrt{3}}{4}s \right) \right|
= \frac{1}{2} \left| \frac{s}{2} \left( \frac{\sqrt{3} - 4}{4}s \right) + s \left( \frac{4 - \sqrt{3}}{4}s \right) \right|
\]
