= \frac{1}{2} \left| \frac{s^2 (\sqrt{3} - 4)}{8} + \frac{2s^2 (4 - \sqrt{3})}{8} \right|
= \frac{1}{2} \left| \frac{s^2 (\sqrt{3} - 4 + 8 - 2\sqrt{3})}{8} \right|
