The minimum value of $S$ is 28. This result comes from evaluating all possible permutations of the labels 1 through 8 and calculating the sum of the absolute differences for each permutation. The configuration that results in the smallest sum is the one that minimizes these absolute differences.
</think>

<answer>
The minimum value of $S$ is \boxed{28}.
</answer>, ground_truth: 28
