\[
-5^{1009} \equiv -1^{1009} \cdot 807 \equiv -807 \equiv 1210 \pmod{2017}
\]
So, the remainder when \(a_0^2 + a_1^2 + \cdots + a_{2018}^2\) is divided by 2017 is:
