- At $x = 3$, $\sin 3 \approx 0.1411$ and $\lg 3 \approx 0.4771$.
- For $x > 3$, $\sin x$ will be in the range $[-1, 1]$ and $\lg x$ will increase, but there is no simple way to check without numerical methods or a graph.

