For \(f'(1) = 2a\):
\[3(1)^2 + 2a(1) + b = 2a\]
This simplifies to:
\[3 + 2a + b = 2a \Rightarrow b = -3\]

For \(f'(2) = -b\):
\[3(2)^2 + 2a(2) + b = -b\]
